      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我做起了用坐骑山羊来运输的生意，\n但我家的孩子们尺寸都不算大。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĳ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 176,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211505A8D774E86752857509A915C717F8A67658FD08F937684751F610FFF0C000A4F4662115BB676845B695B504EEC5C3A5BF890FD4E0D7B975927300200100002011401330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "唉，要是有更大的坐骑山羊，\n也就能搬运大货物了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĳ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 248,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5509FF0C8981662F670966F45927768457509A915C717F8AFF0C000A4E5F5C3180FD642C8FD059278D2772694E86300200100002011401330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我说啊！你要是有XL尺寸的\n坐骑山羊，能不能让给我？<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n用“查看能力”应该就能知道\n宝可梦的尺寸了！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĳ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 308,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62118BF4554AFF014F608981662F67090058004C5C3A5BF87684000A57509A915C717F8AFF0C80FD4E0D80FD8BA97ED96211FF1F00100001BE01000A7528201C67E5770B80FD529B201D5E948BE55C3180FD77E59053000A5B9D53EF68A676845C3A5BF84E86FF0100100002011401330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 57
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0004>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 424,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00040000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你愿意把XL尺寸的\n坐骑山羊让给我吗？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĳ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 436,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F60613F610F628A0058004C5C3A5BF87684000A57509A915C717F8A8BA97ED962115417FF1F00100002011401330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "请收下！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 484,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BF765364E0BFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "还是算了",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 496,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD8662F7B974E860000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "哦哦！\n是哪只坐骑山羊！？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĳ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 508,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54E654E6FF01000A662F54EA53EA57509A915C717F8AFF01FF1F00100002011401330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你要是捉到了XL尺寸的\n坐骑山羊，就让给我吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĳ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 544,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F608981662F634952304E860058004C5C3A5BF87684000A57509A915C717F8AFF0C5C318BA97ED962115427FF0100100002011401330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "它不是XL尺寸呀。\n拜托你给我尺寸更大的坐骑山羊。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĳ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 600,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5B834E0D662F0058004C5C3A5BF854403002000A62DC62584F607ED962115C3A5BF866F45927768457509A915C717F8A300200100002011401330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "哦哦！好大的坐骑山羊！\n名副其实的XL尺寸！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĳ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 660,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54E654E6FF01597D5927768457509A915C717F8AFF01000A540D526F51765B9E76840058004C5C3A5BF8FF0100100002011401330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "哇啊！这是什么尺寸！？\n比我想象的还要大得多！！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĳ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 716,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54C7554AFF018FD9662F4EC04E485C3A5BF8FF01FF1F000A6BD4621160F38C6176848FD8898159275F97591AFF01FF0100100002011401330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "它看起来能搬很多货物！\n我很期待哦！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĳ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 776,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5B83770B8D77676580FD642C5F88591A8D277269FF01000A62115F88671F5F8554E6FF0100100002011401330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "咩咩～咩！！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54A954A9FF5E54A9FF01FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "……唔咩。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 840,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "20262026551454A930020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "哎呀！\n我当然没有忘记你们啦！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĳ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 852,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54CE5440FF01000A62115F5371366CA167095FD88BB04F604EEC5566FF0100100002011401330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "作为曾经的山羊速多乐，\n你们对这座城市熟得不能再熟啦。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n就拜托你们把这座城市的各种事情\n都告诉新加入的坐骑山羊吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĳ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 892,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F5C4E3A66FE7ECF76845C717F8A901F591A4E50FF0C000A4F604EEC5BF98FD95EA757CE5E02719F5F974E0D80FD518D719F5566300200100001BE01000A5C3162DC62584F604EEC628A8FD95EA757CE5E027684540479CD4E8B60C5000A90FD544A8BC965B052A05165768457509A915C717F8A5427FF0100100002011401330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 65
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1024,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "几年前我运营过\n公共交通山羊速多乐哦。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n但密阿雷也在渐渐改变，\n所以我想和宝可梦做些新的尝试！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĳ",
